    {"p":"听不懂 — can't understand (by listening)","e":"听不懂 literally means \"listen-not-understand\": you hear the words but the meaning doesn't get through. 懂 means \"to understand.\"","x":"我听不懂。 — I don't understand (what I'm hearing)."},
    {"p":"我不会说汉语 — saying what you can't do","e":"不会 + verb means you don't know how to do something. 我不会说汉语 = I can't speak Chinese.","x":"我不会说汉语。 — I can't speak Chinese."},
